				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 1.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["49F88BFF272C28E9"]
			description: [
				"Put those muscles to work!"
				""
				"The millstone has a shaft attachment on its bottom face that allows you to directly power it without a cogwheel. Neat!"
				""
				"Using the handcrank depletes your hunger, and continuing to use it while starving can kill you!"
			]
			id: "7B098E8B56711166"
			subtitle: "Hand-grindin'"
